  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopian Social Accountability Programme (ESAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESAP is a multi-donor trust fund administered by the World Bank and implemented by VNG International.  The programme aims to use social accountability processes to partner with civil society organisations across the country, help citizens address local problems in the delivery of basic services, such as health, education and water, and transform how government and service providers engage citizens to improve the quality of basic service provision. For example, this has been implemented through social accountability committees and community scorecards.</narrative>
  </description>
